          "fields": {
            "display_title": "This paper proposes a decentralized attribution to the generative model trained on the same dataset. The goal is to distinguish the user-end generative models, and thus facilitates the IP-protection. The idea is to use orthogonal keys to distinguish the generated samples from authentic data. Furthermore, this paper provided theoretic insights into the proposed method. Experimental results on MNIST and CelebA datasets backup the claims.",
